\begin_inset Formula $T:M\times S\to S\times A$
\end_inset

 that,
 upon receipt of message 
\begin_inset Formula $m_{k}$
\end_inset

 transitions the internal state 
\begin_inset Formula $s_{i}$
\end_inset

 to a new state 
\begin_inset Formula $s_{j}$
\end_inset

,
 and outputs an action 
\begin_inset Formula $a_{n}$
\end_inset

.
