 quiet;
 almost all guests have left.
 She's sipping on white wine,
 from fairly early in the day,
 trying to maintain a state of mild intoxication,
 trying to maintain a positive affect with a mixture of alcohol,
 social media,
 and a small cloud of old and new friends radiating engagement,
 providing company.
 One of her (female) friends got just a little drunker,
 just a little tireder in that second evening;
 she sent her off to bed,
 but then said,
 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

I'll come join you later;
 I want to sleep with you.
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 Not sexually,
