\begin_layout Standard
Others,
 and their emotional highs and lows that I've gotten to see,
 include Cica and Inga.
 Cica's craziness and lack of grace and balance is a manifestation of a blind seeking for something unattainable:
 success as artist.
 Recognition as person.
 Desire for fame.
 My cousin Ieva's romantic longings.
 The Vytas and Rūta,
